    1 material from this card, then activate this effect depending on whose turn
    it is;\r\n\u25CF Yours: Banish up to 1 card each from your opponent's field and
    GY.\r\n\u25CF Opponent's: Look at your opponent's hand and banish 1 card from
    it face-up, until the End Phase.\r\nYou can only use this effect of \"K9-X \"Werewolf\"
    once per turn."
